&lt;li&gt;Lead the Instrumentation and Control design for projects and define control scheme in alignment with industry and client standards to satisfy power system reliability requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review data sheets, control block diagrams, and functional/ operational descriptions for all instrumentation related projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership and serves as a subject matter expert, delivering professional and technical guidance on programs, projects and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support team members, offering guidance and encouraging initiative while helping them develop as engineers and technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
